  "Description": {
    "Cost": 3120959,
    "UIName": "Blue Flame",
    "Id": "chassisdef_blue_flame_BLF-QSK",
    "Name": "Blue Flame",
    "Details": "Gotta go fast? We here at Quicksell have you covered with the blazing <i>Blue Flame</i>. Faster than even most light 'Mechs, the only thing that can outrun it is our Blue Hedgehog. Knowing that speedy 'Mechs often have issues tracking targets, we've packed a pair of LBX Lasers into the turret, providing a solid chance of connecting with any target you can see on the screen.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Barghest"
  },
  "VariantName": "BLF-QSK",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": [
      "QuadMech",
      "mr-resize-0.64-0.68-0.68"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Hunter",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Blue Flame began production after the Word of Blake took possession of Terra. The same factory that had produced the Shootist was upgraded to produce four legged BattleMechs. The Blue Flame is an extremely stable platform due to its quadrupedal configuration. In the later years of the Jihad, an engineer who had helped build the 'Mech stole the design specs and later created the Thunder Fox.",
